旧 `carrier → concept → question` author graph 是 prototype；旧“用户 → 类别 → 作者”也未冻结可视 topology。它们都不能直接成为 production schema。已冻结的只有 AskAuthor Zhihu-first、AuthorSearch network-first、committed relationship trigger、候选不自动入网和刘看山不入网。

## 纵向 Strangler 顺序

1. **工程基线**：自有 workspace/lockfile/Node 24/lint/format/architecture scripts；移除 sibling dependencies/assets。
2. **合同收敛**：把 `../算法/shared/runtime-contracts.ts` 移到唯一 `packages/contracts`；旧包只 re-export，golden fixtures 双边通过。
3. **Transport/store**：api-client decoder/projector + RuntimeStore；页面先改 selector 消费。
4. **Path 纵切**：真实 start/choice/revise/restore → document → 3D；删除页面假 stage 和关键词路线。
5. **Concept 首答纵切**：handoff → singleflight canonical answer → graph/root bootstrap → restore/repair。
6. **Knowledge 纵切**：conversation tree/selection/subsequent answer/incremental graph SSE → read-only canvas；删除 `growGraph`/annotation write/local truth。
7. **Authors 纵切**：真实 Zhihu AskAuthor/direct fallback → network-first search → relationship projector；删除固定作者/local GraphRAG/session network。
8. **其他 context**：identity/sources/attachments/visualization 各自 contracted 后再接，不得借 path/knowledge/authors 偷渡。
9. **清理**：consumer 归零后删除 compatibility adapter、运行时 mock/fixture、旧 storage key 和第二写链；只读示例资产与测试夹具不得进入生产请求 composition。

每个 compatibility 层写明 owner、旧/新 schema、删除条件和 test。旧 browser auth/ID/selection/graph revision 不能“顺便迁移”：必须经 ADR 选择丢弃、只读或服务端重新校验；旧 ID 经 handoff/alias 映射 UUID，DOM selection 重新解析 code-point span/hash。

## 看到即阻断

| 违规 | 必须改成 |
| --- | --- |
| 页面直接 fetch/EventSource + setState 拼领域消息 | api-client decoder → projector → RuntimeStore selector |
| 浏览器 storage 作为 path/conversation/graph/network truth | 服务端 committed fact/read model |
| 图组件 invent 节点/边 | validated schema + view-only renderer |
| DOM Range/数组下标作持久 selection/id | quote + code-point offsets + hashes/stable UUID |
| 路线答题后再调模型 | pure TypeScript prune |
| 路线 ready/3D preload 建 knowledge | valid concept entry 后先 settle canonical，再 bootstrap graph/root |
| re-enter/new conversation/graph repair 重生成首答 | 读取 `CanonicalInitialAnswerRef` |
| 服务端猜 parent/active conversation | request 带明确 id，缺失 4xx |
| evidence/知乎摘要直接冒充回答 | AnswerComposer/typed resolution 或明确失败 |
| ask_author contact proposal/固定作者/graph-first | Zhihu users+content → identity → LLM 选 1–2 → 0 才直达 |
| AuthorSearch 直接知乎/内外混排补三人 | owner network first；0 才知乎；最多 3，不凑数 |
| candidates/top3/Liu 自动写 network | committed real relationship only；刘看山永不实例化 AuthorIdentity |
| Agent/UI/path/authors 写 knowledge nodes | GraphSurgeon + MutationPlan only |
| layout 合并 semantic satellites | 语义不同保持独立 |
| Composer 或持久化草稿出现模式白名单之外的值 | 读取边界归一为空模式；UI 只消费正向白名单 |
| 新建重复 Evidence/UUID/Event schema | 唯一 packages/contracts runtime schema |
| 生产依赖 Python 或 sibling node_modules/public/src | Node.js workspace dependency/synced vendor |
| domain/use case import framework/DB/AI SDK/env | injected port + adapter |
| memory mutex/AbortController 当 durable correctness | DB unique/CAS/lease/fencing |
| provider idempotency header 当本地幂等 | local atomic placeholder + fingerprint + terminal state |
| HTTP 200 包装失败 | typed status/error/resource terminal event |
| 任意 model HTML/JS/component | Surface Catalog + strict props/command allowlist |
| `any`/double assertion/ts-ignore 穿边界 | schema parse；窄 adapter 例外 + issue/test |

## 本地浏览器存储白名单

只允许 theme、density、reduced-motion、未提交 composer draft 和无敏感性能 cache。新增任何其他 key 必须视为架构变更并证明它不是事实源。
